    "created_at": "2026-01-08T15:13:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-08T15:15:10Z",
    "body": "`color(display-p3 none 1 1)` is converted to `#00ffff` with none being treated as 0 in WebKit, while every component becomes `none` in Gecko and that results in `#000000`.\n\n(`color(srgb none 1 1)` becomes `#00ffff` in both)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
