    "body": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color/#missing\n\n> For all other purposes, a [missing component](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color/#missing-color-component) behaves as a zero value, in the appropriate unit for that component: 0, 0%, or 0deg. This includes rendering the color directly, converting it to another color space, performing computations on the color component values, etc.\n\ncc @svgeesus",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
