    "updated_at": "2026-01-09T13:55:16Z",
    "body": "Does [the conversion step](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color/#color-conversion) ensure treating `none` as 0? It has this:\n\n> Replace any [missing component](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color/#missing-color-component) with zero.\n\nbut only for certain representation, namely \"cylindrical polar color\" one. Having this explicit step probably means other steps shouldn't assume it? 🤔 But I'm certainly not a CSS color expert here. ",
