    "created_at": "2026-01-22T20:08:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-22T20:08:46Z",
    "body": "This thing about \"always convert even if it seems like a no-op\" rang a bell but it isn't in the spec.\n\nI did find an issue that mentions it though, in the context of interpolating two colors where one is already in the interpolation colorspace. And it is so that powerless components get changed to missing components:\n\n - https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10211#issuecomment-2075583401\n\nIf that needs to be added, should it be in the html ls or should I add something to CSS Color 4 for html ls to reference?",
