    "created_at": "2026-01-22T20:13:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-22T20:13:11Z",
    "body": "Indeed it was [already suggested to split colorspace conversion into two steps](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10211#issuecomment-2075829784):\n\n1. Convert powerless to missing\n2. Convert to the destination colorspace\n\nThere is a \"need edits\" but also it [isn't clear](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10211#issuecomment-2813894667) how to spec-text the resolutions. I will try to move forward on this soon (there is a CSS f2f next week)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
